WEBVTT

00:46:58.167 --> 00:47:02.851
If somebody googles "COVID,"

00:47:02.875 --> 00:47:07.893
"Safra," "Allen," that's my surname,

00:47:07.917 --> 00:47:09.643
our website will come up.

00:47:09.667 --> 00:47:13.143
So if you just remember those three words,
"COVID," "Safra," "Allen,"

00:47:13.167 --> 00:47:14.434
and Google that,

00:47:14.458 --> 00:47:16.393
you should get to our white papers,

00:47:16.417 --> 00:47:17.934
op-eds, things like that.

00:47:17.958 --> 00:47:21.101
We are hoping to have
our full policy road map

00:47:21.125 --> 00:47:22.934
published by the end of the week.

00:47:22.958 --> 00:47:24.250
That's our target goal.

00:47:25.083 --> 00:47:28.976
CA: Yeah. It's: ethics.harvard.edu.

00:47:29.000 --> 00:47:30.768
DA: OK.